following the success of the inaugural  agilent precision oncology virtual  summit held in may 2021 we will be  hosting a second installation the  ashland ignite hope precision oncology  virtual summit to be held on may 19 2022  precision oncology has transformed many  aspects of the journey to understanding  and defeating cancer  from detection to diagnosis patient care  and disease monitoring agilent believes  in continuous education and partnership  and that includes bringing together  industry trends latest advancements  thought leaders and dynamic idea  exchanges into a common platform join us  at the precision oncology virtual summit  as we collaborate with international key  opinion leaders to discuss topics  including translational insights and the  future of precision oncology  the use of liquid biopsies for lymphoma  research and diagnostic applications  clinically significant biomarkers in  personalized medicine a tissue-based  multiplex biomarker assay as a key  advancement in tissue pathology  don't miss the opportunity to discover  new insights that will bring hope to  cancer patients around the world  see you at the ashland ignite talk  precision oncology virtual summit
 

